                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Optional. A job's status can be SUBMITTED, PROGRESSING, COMPLETE, CANCELED, or ERROR."
              },
              {
                "name": "MaxResults",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Pagination limit"
              },
              {
                "name": "NextToken",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Pagination token"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Retrieve a JSON array of up to twenty of your most recently created jobs. This array includes in-process, completed, and errored jobs. This will return the jobs themselves, not just a list of the jobs. To retrieve the twenty next most recent jobs, use the nextToken string returned with the array."
